HYP-3140 / codex-2026-06-27-S273
14-sheet fiber PGF certificate for the LRC14 Rprime floor
Refines the HYP-3136 integrated multi-far factorization at its Rprime factor

ASSUMPTION CHALLENGE
Vertices need not be runners.  This scout uses u-fibers and sheet-count coefficients as vertices/observables; runners are remembered only through the R-safe sheet packet.  The preserved predicate is the LRC14 covering floor Rprime>0.  The destroyed information is the identity of individual safe sheets unless the PGF coefficient or global-consistency sidecar keeps it.

IDENTITY
N_R(u)=number of R-safe lifts (u+a)/14, a=0..13
Rprime = E[N_R(u) | Q-lonely] / E[N_R(u)]

